### Peticiones de ejemplo para rabbit-admin-service (extension REST Client de VS Code)
### Pega en @token el Access Token de un usuario con App Role ADMIN
### (se puede copiar desde el navegador tras iniciar sesion en el frontend).

@host = http://localhost:8081
@token = PEGA_AQUI_TU_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 0. Salud (publico)
GET {{host}}/public/health

### 1. Crear exchange
POST {{host}}/api/exchanges
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "pedidos360.reportes.exchange", "type": "topic" }

### 2. Crear cola con DLQ, TTL y largo maximo
POST {{host}}/api/queues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "pedidos360.reportes.queue",
  "durable": true,
  "deadLetterExchange": "pedidos360.dlx",
  "deadLetterRoutingKey": "reportes.dlq",
  "messageTtl": 60000,
  "maxLength": 1000
}

### 3. Crear binding
POST {{host}}/api/bindings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "queue": "pedidos360.reportes.queue", "exchange": "pedidos360.reportes.exchange", "routingKey": "reporte.#" }

### 4. Consultar cola
GET {{host}}/api/queues/pedidos360.reportes.queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Eliminar binding
DELETE {{host}}/api/bindings?queue=pedidos360.reportes.queue&exchange=pedidos360.reportes.exchange&routingKey=reporte.%23
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Eliminar cola
DELETE {{host}}/api/queues/pedidos360.reportes.queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Eliminar exchange
DELETE {{host}}/api/exchanges/pedidos360.reportes.exchange
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Casos de error ---

### 8. Nombre vacio -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/queues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "" }

### 9. Configuracion invalida (TTL negativo, nombre reservado, routing key de DLQ sin exchange) -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/queues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "amq.demo", "messageTtl": -5, "deadLetterRoutingKey": "x" }

### 10. Tipo de exchange invalido -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/exchanges
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "demo.exchange", "type": "inventado" }

### 11. Cola inexistente -> 404
DELETE {{host}}/api/queues/no.existe
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Sin token -> 401
POST {{host}}/api/queues
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "demo.queue" }
